      <ul>
        <li>You agree to pay all applicable charges and fees</li>
        <li>All sales are final unless otherwise stated</li>
        <li>Digital downloads are delivered immediately upon payment</li>
        <li>Promo codes are subject to their specific terms and expiration</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h2>5. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>All content on MELORI MUSIC, including music, artwork, and text, is protected by copyright and other intellectual property laws. You may not:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Reproduce, distribute, or publicly display content without permission</li>
        <li>Use purchased music for commercial purposes without a license</li>
        <li>Remove or modify any copyright notices</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h2>6. User Conduct</h2>
      <p>You agree not to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Upload or share illegal, harmful, or offensive content</li>
        <li>Harass, abuse, or harm other users</li>
        <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to the platform</li>
        <li>Use automated systems to access the service</li>
        <li>Interfere with the proper functioning of the platform</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h2>7. Content Guidelines</h2>
      <p>All user-generated content, including reviews and comments, must:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Be respectful and constructive</li>
        <li>Not contain spam, hate speech, or harassment</li>
        <li>Not violate any third-party rights</li>
        <li>Be relevant to the music or artist being discussed</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h2>8. Termination</h2>
      <p>We reserve the right to terminate or suspend your account at any time for violations of these terms or for any other reason at our discretion.</p>
      
      <h2>9. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>The platform is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We do not guarantee uninterrupted or error-free service.</p>
      
      <h2>10. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>MELORI MUSIC shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of the platform.</p>
      
      <h2>11. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms at any time. Continued use of the platform after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>
      
      <h2>12. Contact</h2>
      <p>For questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@melorimusic.com" style="color: var(--primary-color);">support@melorimusic.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </main>
  
  <%- include('partials/footer-simple') %>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
